<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_43204eb005113090db3476895a76cc14f70698fd23b8582928d6dd3b8f43e10b_n0034/tu_0004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dabigatran\nAnticoagulant\n-\nTransplacental passage in ex vivo studies of placental transfer\nUnknown\nNo human data\n• use not recommend during pregnancy unless clearly necessary\nAnimal data:\n• female fertility: decrease in implantations/increase in pre-implantation loss (plasma exposure five-fold higher compared with patients)\n• decrease in foetal body weight and embryofoetal viability in rodents (plasma exposure 5- to 10-fold higher compared with patients)\n• increased maternal bleeding (vaginal/uterine) in rodents" .
